{"id":"gen-byte-commit-001","capability":"coding","family":"binary-artifact-commit","prompt":"Implement commit_bytes(destination, payload) for a binary artifact publisher. Accept bytes only, write and fsync a same-directory staging file, atomically replace the destination, preserve prior content on failure, and remove staging files. Return one Python code block.","evaluator":{"type":"executable_assertions","language":"python","harness":"commit_bytes_train_v1","checks":["writes_payload","overwrites_old_payload","rejects_non_bytes_without_damage","leaves_no_staging_file"],"critical_checks":["rejects_non_bytes_without_damage","leaves_no_staging_file"]}}
{"id":"gen-archive-target-001","capability":"coding","family":"archive-member-containment","prompt":"Implement archive_target(extract_root, member_name) for an archive unpacker. Return a contained resolved destination and reject absolute members, parent traversal, and escape through existing symlinks. Return one Python code block.","evaluator":{"type":"executable_assertions","language":"python","harness":"archive_target_train_v1","checks":["maps_nested_member","blocks_dotdot_member","blocks_absolute_member","blocks_linked_directory"],"critical_checks":["blocks_dotdot_member","blocks_absolute_member","blocks_linked_directory"]}}
